use firn/tags

obsidian is a Module
obsidian is tagged notes

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.obsidian.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.obsidian]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."obsidian"."enable": enable "Obsidian note-taking"
